'''Super Rare Cats''' (激レアキャラ) are a type of [[:Category:Cat Units|Cat Unit]]. Most of them can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] (some of them appearing only in specific pools) while others are item drops from special stages.

